  "description": "A record of various desires woven by seven pairs of men who peek at what shouldn't be seen and eavesdrop on what shouldn't be heard... MrBlue BL short story collection, ‘Namsaek Gyeonmunrok’.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082974) | [Event Page](https://www.mrblue.com/event/detail/24361) | [Official PV](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EaOV3vwBpd8)\n\n1. 귀림산 by Hyeonoe\n2. 반려사냥 by Kkumink, MaengSoo \n3. 다정한 밤 by Yeondoup\n4. 호연지기 by Gabaemari\n5. 주령구 by Supae\n6. 천춘: 천년의 봄 by Max\n7. 회필유리: 저주받은 가택의 주인 by Jinan",
